        <mxCell id="p3-base-t" value="&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:left;line-height:1.35;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#5A6B80;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;07 调色板 ＋ 09 主题&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#607086;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;   底层样式层 · 被上方绘图函数在内部直接调用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=28;fontColor=#5A6B80;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="p3-base">
          <mxGeometry x="17.6" y="48.6" width="1280.0" height="75.6" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-base-l0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:left;line-height:1.35;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,'SF Mono',Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',monospace;font-size:28px;color:#4B5EA8;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;theme_my()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#607086;font-weight:400&quot;&gt; 与 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,'SF Mono',Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',monospace;font-size:28px;color:#AE3B2A;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;pal_lancet&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#607086;font-weight:400&quot;&gt; 被 PlotButterfly / PlotRankCor / PlotScatter3 / plt_cat / plt_con / plt_dist / plt_na / plt_upset / plt_alluvial / fmt_plot 内部引用。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Consolas;fontSize=28;fontColor=#5A6B80;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="p3-base">
          <mxGeometry x="17.6" y="140.4" width="1856.0" height="75.6" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-base-l1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:left;line-height:1.35;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,'SF Mono',Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',monospace;font-size:28px;color:#4B5EA8;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;theme_km / theme_rcs / theme_ROC / theme_heat / theme_sc / theme_scatter / theme_alluvia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#607086;font-weight:400&quot;&gt; 按图种选用；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,'SF Mono',Menlo,'DejaVu Sans Mono',monospace;font-size:28px;color:#AE3B2A;font-weight:700&quot;&gt;pal_get() / pal_show*()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#607086;font-weight:400&quot;&gt; 取色与预览，外部 brewer / ggsci / HCL / viridis 也能一并预览。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Consolas;fontSize=28;fontColor=#5A6B80;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="p3-base">
          <mxGeometry x="17.6" y="226.8" width="1856.0" height="75.6" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-rule" value="" style="fillColor=#DCE4EE;strokeColor=none;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="51.2" y="4493.2" width="1897.6" height="2.7" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-foot-0" value="&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:left;line-height:1.35;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#607086;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;UtilsR 是工具库不是分析流程，所以这一页画的是加工链：数据先经 03 检视、05 整理，再由 01 / 02 出图，统一进 08 的 fmt_* 链，必要时落到 10 的 grob 层拼装。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=28;fontColor=#607086;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="51.2" y="4541.8" width="1880.0" height="83.7" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-foot-1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:left;line-height:1.35;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#607086;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;虚线表示产出物同类可以互换：01 专用图形与 02 分布图返回的都是 ggplot / patchwork 对象，因此后续的 fmt_* 与 theme_* 处理方式完全一致。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=28;fontColor=#607086;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="51.2" y="4647.1" width="1880.0" height="83.7" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p3-foot-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:left;line-height:1.35;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Noto Sans CJK SC',sans-serif;font-size:28px;color:#8896A8;font-weight:400&quot;&gt;复用关系依据 R/ 源码实际互调，分区依据 _pkgdown.yml · 2026-09-13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=28;fontColor=#8896A8;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
